{
  "title": "Eosinophil\u2013adiposity coupling: a small source-sample prediction gain fails transfer to another NHANES cycle",
  "abstract": "In 5,222 NHANES 2007\u20132008 and 5,635 separately sampled 2009\u20132010 adults, adding centered eosinophils \u00d7 BMI to a flexible conventional-count model improved source PSU-CV MSE by 0.001358 but worsened validation log-CRP MSE by 0.001906 (0.169%). Source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval [-0.001254, 0.007993]. The prespecified scalar feature did not transfer as a prediction gain.",
